        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Kimono of red silk satin (<i>shu</i>) with design of dragons and Mount Fuji embroidered in silk and metallic thread. At some point the kimono has been altered; it is shortended and a dark colour and hem have been added. The hem is padded and the whole is lined with red silk. There is a Japanese label attached inside the left sleeve arm."@en ;
